    <!-- Benchmark -->
    <string name="bench_title">BENCHMARK</string>
    <string name="bench_intro">Runs the same PP 512 / TG 128 test three ways on the loaded model: naïve (8 threads across all cores), threads-only (the same thread count ENTITY picks, but with core pinning switched off), and ENTITY Auto (the shipped configuration, generation pinned to the performance cores). The middle run separates the gain from the thread count from the gain from pinning. Power draw is measured too. Unplug the phone: power and tokens-per-watt are hidden while charging.</string>
